        "content": "<p>dhil opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14447\">PR #14447</a> from <code>dhil:stack-switching-regression-test</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As I started working on issue #13298, I realised that it has already been fixed by one of the previous stack switching PRs. Thus, this patch simply adds the PoC from the issue as a regression test.</p>\n<p>Resolves #13298.</p>\n<p>I think this is the last of the known issues regarding VM state corruption due to stack switching. I will look into the missing stack bounds checking / defense-in-depth checking issues next.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
